<%# Public, read-only reservations board. Renders each upcoming confirmed
    reservation as "party size · restaurant (neighbourhood) · table · time
    (zone) · <diner name>". Spans ALL restaurants in the aggregator. Shared by the home
    page and the standalone /reservations page. Read-only — no forms, no
    actions; it only mirrors what assistants booked. %>
<div class="board">
  <div class="board-head">
    <div>
      <div class="board-title">Reservations board</div>
      <div class="board-sub">Upcoming bookings across the atablefor restaurants — updates as assistants book.</div>
    </div>
    <span class="board-count"><%= @reservations.length %> upcoming</span>
  </div>

  <% if @reservations.empty? %>
    <p class="board-empty">No upcoming reservations yet. Point an assistant at this site and book one.</p>
  <% else %>
    <ul class="res-list">
      <%= render @reservations %>
    </ul>
    <p class="board-note">Names are the diners the bookings are linked to — an assistant's booking shows under its diner's account. Booking a table costs nothing.</p>
  <% end %>
</div>
